docs/adr/0009-canonical-output-interns-props.md:9:Inherited props repeat on every component that inherits them. On Mantine, 19,506 props hold 3,137 distinct values, and the canonical JSON is 19.3 MB. The Vite plugin serves that whole output as its virtual module and re-serves it after every edit, so the browser downloads and parses all of it (34 ms in `JSON.parse` on Mantine) each time. Storybook does not read this format: both its build-time `__docgenInfo` and its Storybook 11 docgen providers take RDT-shaped props, which an integration converts to.
